  "title": "Gamified rebates: the full-price promotion that pays shoppers back when a real-world event hits",
  "summary": "A gamified rebate is a promotion where shoppers pay full price for a real chance to win 100% of their money back if a real-world trigger hits, like a game going to overtime, snow falling on Christmas, or a brand hitting a milestone. The brand keeps full margin at checkout, and revenue lands in Shopify the normal way. P",
